  "long_description": "Our mission is to empower every manufacturer, no matter their scale, to invent and build anything using intelligent robots.\r\n\r\nToday’s industrial robots are fast but \"blind\". They struggle with any task that isn't perfectly repetitive. We are building the eyes and brain (a proprietary vision system and AI model) that allow industrial robots to see, reason, and perform complex work with sub-millimeter accuracy and the adaptability of a human expert.\r\n\r\nWe are witnessing the start of a new industrial revolution: an era of advanced manufacturing powered by AI and robotics. We aim to lead this shift by putting these tools into the hands of every manufacturer, ensuring the power to invent and build at scale isn’t a privilege of the few.",
